{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1000_p", "source_sha256": "098bfcef5ee8371a5ad17678870a651f0bcc3ad0be3cafa1c34afb70d0830e45", "ja": "（今日は可憐の衣装合わせの日だ。\n少し大胆な衣装になってしまったけど、大丈夫かな？）", "zh": "（今天是可怜试穿服装的日子。结果换成了稍微大胆的服装，不知道没问题吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "68693213c2921aed2f1769ca65683679e22196184e156f8610f48ac2fb020da0", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん……。\nお、お疲れさまです……。その、どうですか……？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生……\n您、您辛苦了……那个，觉得怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d99c49c51abe3f801385dfb4b32d82b42f442cabc050d199df0b77a7c9e60963", "ja": "ああ、よく似合ってるよ。\nデザインでは、少しセクシーかなと思ったけど……。", "zh": "嗯，很适合你。看设计图时，我还觉得会不会有点性感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "744c901e90f0ca6bd0cd7fd51de99cbc542ea63e7e8ce2d5a70f7c4c37cd8059", "ja": "ううっ、{$P$}さんも……\nせ、セクシーだって、思ってたんですね……。", "zh": "呜呜，连{$P$}先生也……\n觉得……很、很性感啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "359cb904c430e52a1aaa3525e66a395cc3619760d26685107dbd868cdef02fd4", "ja": "き、着替えるのに、ちょっと勇気がいりましたけど……\n素敵な衣装だったから、が、頑張りたいなって……。", "zh": "换衣服的时候，确实需要鼓起一点勇气……\n不过因为是很棒的服装，所以我、我想努力试试……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cae39e40b69400b9cc71440b03f47af295fa294ecc0334c6fa4fe9d49c3f151c", "ja": "そうだったのか。うん、バッチリだと思うよ。\nあれ？　髪型もなんだか違うような……？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。嗯，我觉得非常棒。\n咦？发型好像也有点不一样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "5e7543af2dcb9d9679f453d1e4e1dd8714e15933922381b5669d6368144b4d35", "ja": "あっ……そ、そうなんです……！\n少しでも派手に見えるように、考えてみたんです……。", "zh": "啊……是、是这样的……！\n为了看起来哪怕华丽一点，我就想了想……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "7981bd8f5a5d105cdc108534e61b2b92b8d58b10c5acb560bec5d4cbe99cea48", "ja": "衣装がセクシーなので、こういうのがいいかなって。\nあの……地味になってないですか……？", "zh": "因为服装很性感，我觉得这样搭配也许不错。那个……看起来有没有显得太朴素……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5d1679264d738bee31841263afdd2bf1b2cfd747efeaa70308e5ebde0777cf86", "ja": "大丈夫。衣装にも合ってるし、いいアレンジだ。\nしかし髪型を変えるなんて……思い切ったな？", "zh": "没问题。和服装很搭，改编得很棒。\n不过居然改变了发型……还真是下定了决心呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "965b9c187ea0493615f1d02b035fd4968957ab3035fc4b140c7073515557b5e3", "ja": "そ、それは……。いつもの私だと、\n衣装に負けちゃうかもって、思ったんです……。", "zh": "那、那是因为……我觉得如果还是平时的我，可能会被服装比下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "3f3e09ff84dfb67593bd452272e7531f337de25625e978cddfc9c1b781a2527a", "ja": "た、体型や性格は、変えられませんけど……\n髪型なら、いろいろなアレンジができますから……。", "zh": "体、体型和性格虽然没法改变……但发型的话，可以做出各种各样的造型……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1011_p", "source_sha256": "496e7628bf9e2cbe1f962ba3588f5ee623f5ec22d230695823adb8a8d711e544", "ja": "そうか。よく頑張ったな。", "zh": "这样啊。你很努力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "98e210b0aae555622cbf70af71a6f5cb07a9a497c17947a6c553089062945229", "ja": "えへへ……♪　あ、でも喜ぶのは早いですよね……。\nレース場でのお仕事だってありますし……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪　啊，不过现在高兴还太早了吧……。\n毕竟还有在赛车场的工作……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4bc45e99aa8662d1e39028f8dfb353f15167c6c2a6242b8a6bd033436ddbf90c", "ja": "ああ。レースクイーンは、\n注目を集めるのが仕事みたいなものだからな。", "zh": "对。赛车女郎的工作，说白了就是吸引大家的目光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "3b378d6a791bc72511c87c96c3f3e262506028f50a333356c4828a0cd432c09b", "ja": "そう、ですよね……。たくさんの人が、私を見に……\nあぅ……そ、想像したら、不安になってきました……！", "zh": "对、对吧……会有很多人来看我……\n啊呜……一、想到那个，就开始不安起来了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a2e50fd35ca997dcdb546c17af171a0519a1a081cfa0d919b07c04f25058f795", "ja": "お、落ち着け可憐。大丈夫だから！\n……そうだ。何か協力できることはないか？", "zh": "可、可怜，冷静一点。没事的！\n……对了，有没有什么我能帮上忙的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e549f5b7cb0330c159b85c3a6af107e970ce686d3b32d3b3e39cc0a3fc3d332e", "ja": "不安が少しでも和らげば、\n人の目も、多少は平気になるかもしれない！", "zh": "要是能稍微缓解一点不安，\n说不定也能多少适应别人的目光了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "c7df907f943339688a507fb3ce65f1467f4267002fe84aaeb16b0dae061872dc", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。そ、それなら……\nあの……私のこと、じっくり眺めてくれませんか……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。那、那样的话……\n那个……您能不能仔细地看看我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "2e0755ee25a804e09a0fe04550e432b65b462856f64d53abea3d769938313b13", "ja": "レースクイーンは、人に見られるのがお仕事です……。\nでも、大勢の前に出るのは、やっぱり慣れなくて……。", "zh": "赛车女郎的工作，就是接受大家的注视……  \n可是，要面对那么多人，我果然还是不太习惯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "2ad5eacc52ff7a6dde13c0c5bad8074af2a67c46201d726dfff2b62bb5ecb469", "ja": "まずは{$P$}さんと、特訓して……\nす、少しずつ、視線に慣れていけたらなって……。", "zh": "首先和{$P$}先生一起特训……  \n要是能、能一点一点习惯大家的视线就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1020_p", "source_sha256": "9760f0d47cd5ed703cd5d158dcff5640d18a205231e3f7526f903250eddb4b39", "ja": "わかった。そういうことなら、お安い御用だ！\nそれじゃ、眺めるぞ！　……じーっ。", "zh": "明白了。要是这样的话，包在我身上！\n那我可要盯着你看咯！……盯——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "629de1dd8b12ca9924f2995d9a3b09bc68cf84d521bbec1d1c6f5d4f6b0f84bb", "ja": "あ、ああっ……！　ま、待ってください……！\n心の準備が、まだできてなくて……ううっ……。", "zh": "啊、啊啊……！请、请等一下……！\n我还没有做好心理准备……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0294_1022_p", "source_sha256": "9f48aa7f8dd14c4f64f47361611abcbb68fb7ab6b49a43b04af198e8e6da0542", "ja": "（目を見つめるのは、少し早かったみたいだな……。\n慌てずに、可憐のペースに合わせて特訓していこう）", "zh": "（看来现在和她对视还是有点早了……别慌，配合可怜的节奏进行特训吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
